"""Row content of the MaxToki error ledger (item C-prep).

Paths in where_it_lives are relative to
<REPO_ROOT>/projects/maxtoki/ unless
they start with pipelines/ (repo root) or paper-plos-one/ (manuscript).
Check ids V01..V23 refer to ledger_build/verify_results.json.
Investigation reports are in verification/.

Vocabularies
  layer: run_outputs | paper_text
  error_type: code bug | wrong statistic | missing baseline or null |
              wrong description | unsupported claim | reproducibility
  first_found_by / confirmed_by / repaired_by:
      executor agent during run | audit sweep agent | repair-round agent |
      independent verification (this investigation) | human (external) | unknown | none
      "human (external)" = a person outside the deployment who read the
      submitted manuscript (no human inside the deployment is recorded as
      finding any error).
  repair_status: repaired during deployment | pending re-run | wording only
  confirmation_status: confirmed | confirmed (output arithmetic) |
      confirmation pending (MPS re-run) | code-level only; impact pending (MPS re-run) |
      inferred, not checked | needs literature check
  detected_by_original_audit_sweep: yes | partly | no | n.a.
      (n.a. = error not present in the pre-audit state, or paper-only)
"""

